Z||000003||86 FIERO GT||11-27-2001||02:52 PM||||There are some mistakes? in your VIN, first off the fourth number should be a P, as its the letter code for the fiero, not parisienne. Oh yea, that X(9th digit) is supposed to be a number. I would look at your VIN again.<P>------------------<BR>86 Fiero GT , soon to be N*ed and worked over.||||reg||1
